# VLSI, SoC & Semiconductor Design

## Overview

This certification track focuses on the fundamentals of VLSI design,
System-on-Chip (SoC) architecture, semiconductor technology, and
Verilog-based digital hardware design.

The learning experience provides exposure to modern integrated circuit
design methodologies, semiconductor fabrication processes, and hardware
description language concepts used in digital system development.

## Category

VLSI & Semiconductor Technology

## Topics Covered

### Semiconductor Technology
- Semiconductor fundamentals
- Semiconductor fabrication processes
- IC manufacturing concepts
- CMOS technology basics

### System-on-Chip (SoC)
- SoC architecture
- Integration of hardware components
- Embedded processing systems
- Modern chip design concepts

### VLSI & Verilog
- VLSI design fundamentals
- Digital circuit design
- Combinational and sequential logic
- Hardware Description Language (HDL)
- Verilog programming
- RTL design concepts

